{"id":"wt_c4_08","name":"为了友谊传递的鲜香","des":"布拉格乌尔庄园的索洛罗哆想请你为她带一份松茸鲜汤。准备黑森林松茸干、肉类、野菜各一份，即可在营地烹饪出松茸鲜汤。","des2":"我、我、我是索洛罗哆……庄、庄园的一只小、小蕈人噗……我有个好、好朋友在金弦之厅，是个厉害的布、布宴者噗。她鼻子有点疾、疾病……闻不到好多食物的香味噗……但、但我知道有一种松茸菜肴……大家都说它香味四溢，说不定能让她重新感受到一点美食的鲜香噗！……但我只、只是一只小小蕈人……能、能不能请各位帮我制作一份，我、我、我……我好想帮帮我的这位好朋友噗……！","type":3,"typeLabel":"委托","typeOrder":2,"subRaw":"C4","subLabel":"黑森林","subKey":"C4","close":false,"reward":{"entries":[{"kind":"money","name":"银币","count":700,"rawMin":700,"rawMax":700,"min":700,"max":700,"countMin":700,"countMax":700,"typeId":"item_00001","icon":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"groupIndex":0,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1},{"kind":"item","name":"黑森林纪念币","count":7,"rawMin":7,"rawMax":7,"min":7,"max":7,"countMin":7,"countMax":7,"typeId":"item_29104","icon":"/Common_ItemIcon/item_29104.webp","quality":4,"groupIndex":1,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1},{"kind":"item","name":"白沙蒙布朗","count":1,"rawMin":1,"rawMax":1,"min":1,"max":1,"countMin":1,"countMax":1,"typeId":"item_27004","icon":"/Common_ItemIcon/item_27004.webp","quality":3,"groupIndex":2,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1}],"text":[]},"startLocation":"储存场（黑森林 > 布拉格乌尔庄园）","startNpc":{"name":"索洛罗哆","id":"cart_at_npc_Thorolodd"},"getTask":{"npc":{"name":"索洛罗哆","id":"cart_at_npc_Thorolodd","line":"","kind":"cart"},"title":"索洛罗哆","dialog":{"raw":"提交 1 份松茸鲜汤。","isText":true,"name":""},"condition":"完成《蕈人的庄园》"},"predecessorTasks":[{"id":"m_4_4","name":"蕈人的庄园","type":"condition"}],"addTasks":[],"unlockTasks":[],"unlockStages":[],"steps":[{"index":1,"name":"提交 1 份松茸鲜汤。","des":"布拉格乌尔庄园的索洛罗哆想请你为她带一份松茸鲜汤。准备黑森林松茸干、肉类、野菜各一份，即可在营地烹饪出松茸鲜汤。","type":"getItemNpc","typeName":"提交道具给NPC","reward":{"entries":[],"text":[]},"unlockStages":[],"unlockSuppressed":false,"detail":[{"label":"说明","value":"提交后扣除道具"},{"label":"NPC","value":"索洛罗哆"},{"label":"房间","value":"储存场（黑森林 > 布拉格乌尔庄园）"},{"label":"交互对话","value":"（提交松茸鲜汤。）"}],"dialogs":